      "html" : "<\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-180982\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-180982\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>The construction of masonry fireplaces shall be in accordance with this section, <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-180981', hash: '#JD_BCTable2111.1' }}\">Table 2111.1<\/Link> and <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-180981', hash: '#JD_BCFigure2111.1' }}\">Figure 2111.1<\/Link>. All masonry fireplaces shall be installed, altered and maintained in buildings in conformity with the applicable provisions of the <span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">New York City Mechanical Code<\/span>, the <span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">New York City Fuel Gas Code<\/span> and the <span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">New York City Air Pollution Control Code<\/span>. No new masonry fireplaces shall be permitted except those that burn the types of fuel allowed by Section <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-43437', hash: '#JD_24-149.2' }}\">24-149.2<\/Link> of the <span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">New York City Air Pollution Control Code<\/span>.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-180983\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-180983\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><a name=\"JD_BCTable2111.1\" id=\"JD_BCTable2111.1\" title=\"BC Table 2111.1\"><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Table 2111.1<br><\/br>Requirements for Masonry Fireplaces and Chimneys <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;ver